    "Each timeline contains exactly one1808at0 plus its original1or2 paid-cart completions; aggregate8+13=21. No562/584 completed or primary entity survives.",
    "All8 first-step snapshots show3 villagers,4/5 population,200F200W100G200S and3 assigned builders. Full pre-first-camp steps0/1, clocks/stocks/pop/allocations and paid-birth prefixes match genuine M2.",
    "All8 timelines finish without timeout or bonus-villager events. Timing values in this report are actual saved output, not predicted balance assertions.",
    "12 camp-containing steps expose80W20F as the first train/build cost; archers-19 step8 exposes only its firstHouse25W. Two80W20F records are attached to displayed ageup101 steps because primary-action priority and cost selection are separate existing API contracts.",
    "Two primary matching research starts are directly exposed: scouts202 and drush-fc22. Two Blacksmith40s site waits release on the next0.1s tick after observed103 completion. Other19 individual research starts/completions are not exposed.",
